{"unit_id":"FireflyLover520__dsh-game-uid#feature-1","repo":"FireflyLover520/dsh-game-uid","commit":"c20a1ae89c325ce6feb8d717e690daabb647e39e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-game-uid 的功能「UID 练度查询」：输入原神、星铁或绝区零 UID，可自动识别或指定游戏，查询公开展柜/支援角色并生成包含等级、武器、技能、汇总面板和装备套装的报告；可按角色名筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-44","lib/uid-core.mjs:819-850","lib/uid-core.mjs:913-990","lib/uid-core.mjs:1033-1043"]}
